        "sid": "ACT 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaniset ne mi Antiokia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimi kaniset ne kimi Antiokia, maotik ak konetik, Barnaba, ak Simion ne kigiguure Niger, ak Lukio ne bo Kurene, ak Manaen ne kigigui koboto kiruogindet Herod, ak Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kiboisiechin Kiptaiyat ak korugutegei, kole Tamirmiriet ne Tilil, Otabanwa Barnaba ak Saul agobo boisiet ne kiaguurji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingo kagorugutgei ak kosaei ak kogonoor ichek eunekwak, koyokto koba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Barnaba ak Saul eng’ Kupro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagoyokto ichek Tamirmiriet ne Tilil, kochorjigei Seleukia; ak kiba eng’ oloto kobun melit agoi Kupro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kimitei Salamis, koamda ng’olyotab Jehovah eng’ sunagogisiekab Yahudik: ak kimi koboto Johana ne kiboisiechinoti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagobun emet komugul ne kiikwen beek agoi koit Papos, konyorji oloto bonin, maotio ne bo lembech, ne Yahudiot, ne kigiguure Bar-Jesu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne kimi koboto bounindet, Sergio Paulos, chito ne ng’om. Kiguur chichito Barnaba ak Saul koba ole mi inendet, ak kimachei kogas ng’olyotab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kigirinda ichek Eluma ng’orindet (amu u noto kainennyi ye kiweech), kigirinda bounindonoto, kocheng’ei komaas kole si manyor kayanet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kinyi Tamirmiriet ne Tilil Saul, ne kiguure Paulo, ak kiichiilji kong’, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kole, Ee inye ne nyiitat ng’alset tugul ak ng’omnatet tugul ne bo kabeetet, inye weritab oindet, inye bunyotab imanda tugul, mebagaktoi imaas ortinwek che lititen che bo Kiptaiyat? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak keer nguno anyun-o, mi eutab Kiptaiyat baragung’ung’, ak iegu kipkoratia, si mata igeer asista eng’ betusiek alak. Ak kiibutyi ngunoto mirmirindo ak mesundeito; ak kiwendot kocheng’at bik che namoti inendet eut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingogeer anyun bounindet kit ne kayaak, koyan, kokwong’ agobo konetisietab Kiptaiyat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Antiokia eng’ Pisidia: Amdaet ne Kiamji Paulo Yahudik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiba anyun Paulo ak che kimi koboto inendet kobun melit eng’ Papos, ak koit Perga eng’ Pampulia: ak kiwa Johana koweektagei Jerusalem kobagakta ichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingobun ichek Perga, koit Antiokia ne bo Pisidia; ak kiba sunagogit eng’ betutab sabato, ak koteb ng’ony.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingobata somanetab Ng’atutiet ak sirutikab maotik koyokto bounikab sunagogit bik koba ole mi ichek, kolenji, Che kitupche, ngotinye ng’olyo age tugul ne imuchi kotoret bichu, omwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotonon anyun Paulo, ak koborjine eut, kole, Ogaso okwek bikab Israel, ak okwek che oiywei Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilewen Jehovah ne bo bichu Israel kwanisiekyok, ak kotoror bichoto ye ki bunotik eng’ emetab Misri, ak kiimut ichek komong’ eng’ eut ne kim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimuitochi ichek eng’ atebosiekwak eng’ olo bo kenyisiek artam eng’ ong’atet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagong’em bororiosiek tisab eng’ emetab Kanan, kogochi ichek emenywa koek borotet, eng’ olo bo kenyisiek bogol ang’wan ak konom: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kingobata tuguchu kogochi ichek kiruogik agoi Samuel maotiot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingobata kosom laitoriat: ak kiigochi Jehovah ichek Saul weritab Kis eng’ kenyisiek artam, chito ne bo oretab Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagoisto inendet, kong’eetyi Daudi koek laitoriandenywa; ne kibaorianji agine kole, Kaanyoru Daudi weritab Jesii, chito ne iboiboi muguleldanyu, ne tun yaei magutikyuk tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiimutyi Jehovah Israel Yetindet, Jesu, eng’ keswekab chichito, ko u arorutiet; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye kiga sib koamji Johana bik tugul che bo Israel, kabatisanet ne bo sigunet, ye kitomo konyo inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye ki negit koges Johana bandanyi, komwa kole, Olen a ng’o? Ma a inendet. Ago ogeero, isubwa age, ne manyoljina atiakyi kweonikab kelyekyik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Che kitupche, lagokab keswek che bo Abraham, ak alak che mi kwenung’wong’ che iywei Jehovah, kagiyokwech achek ng’olyondoni bo yetunet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichek che menyei Jerusalem, koboto bounikwak, amu kima nai inendet, anan kutuswekab maotik che kisomani eng’ sabato age tugul, kosuldae kutuswechuto kiruoget ne kiiruokyi inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak nganda kimanyor eng’ inendet ng’olyot ne igochin kome, ago kisom ichek Pilato kole, kebar inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ye kingo kagoges tuguk tugul che kiga kisir agobo inendet, kochoor inendet eng’ ketit, ak konde kererit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kiing’eet Jehovah inendet komong’ eng’ che kibek: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kigeer inendet eng’ betusiek che chang’ ichek che kitogosu koboto inendet kobunu Galili kobwanei Jerusalem, che nguno ko baorinik eng’ bik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiibwok logoiywek che miach che bo arorutiet, ne kigigochi kwanisiekyok, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ko u ye kigosuldochi Jehovah lagokyok noto, amu kiing’eet Jesu; ko u ye sirat eng’ Tiendab Kalosunet ne bo aeng’, kole, I werinnyu, kaasichin rani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ko u ye kiing’eet inendet komong’ eng’ che kibek, ma koweekyingei amu inendet kogeny nunet, kimwa ko u ni, kole, Tun agonin kaberuroik che tililen, ak ko bo iman, che bo Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kimwa agine eng’ Tiendo age, kole, Matun igochini neng’ung’ Ne Tilil kogeer nunet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ye kingo kagoboisiechi Daudi kiruogutikab Jehovah eng’ ibindanyi, konuuch, ak kigitub koboto kwanisiekyik, ak kogeer nunet: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ago ma keer nunet inendet ne kiing’eet Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingonaak anyun eng’ okwek, che kitupche, kele, kimwawok eng’ chichi nyoetab kaat ne bo tengekwogik: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kiityin imanda eng’ inendet age tugul ne iyani, eng’ tuguk tugul, che koma komuchi koiityok imanda Ng’atutietab Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oripge anyun, si manyonjok ne kigimwa eng’ maotik; kele,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingota komandoi ichek, kosom kole, tun ko ta koamji ichek ng’alechato eng’ sabato ne nyonei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagomanda tuiyet eng’ sunagogit, kosub Paulo ak Barnaba che chang’ che bo Yahudik ak che konyiti Jehovah che kiwalak kobunji Yahudik: ye kingong’alaljin ichek, kogiil kole koba tai eng’ mieindab Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eng’ sabato ne isubi noto, koyumgei nganaset che negit tugul kole kogas ng’olyotab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ye kingogeer Yahudik tuiyosiek, koam ng’et kong’, ak koesio eng’ kimnatet ng’alek che kimwaei Paulo, ak komwa ng’alek che yaachen kochubis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kong’alal anyun Paulo ak Barnaba eng’ nyiganatet, kolen, Konyolu kemwawok korok ng’olyotab Jehovah. Amu ogirindoi, ak oruokyinige okwege ole manyolu onyoru sobondab koigeny, ogeero, kagibe oldab Bororiosiek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu king’atech Kiptaiyat ko u noto, kole,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogas Bororiosiek ng’olyondonito, koboiboitu, ak kogonyit ng’olyotab Jehovah: ak koyan tugul che kiga kelewenji sobondab koigeny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyom ng’olyotab Kiptaiyat koronoto tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kiinde Yahudik ng’alekab chaamset kobogorisiek che konyiti Jehovah ak ko toogunotin, ak bik che eechen che bo nganaset, ak kiing’eet usisiet kous Paulo ak Barnaba, ak koon komanda eng’ kiwotosiekwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kilelekyi ichek temburiek che mi kelyekwak, ak kiit Ikonio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinyi alamalyet boiboindo ak Tamirmiriet ne Tilil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.13.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
